{"title":"Django 模板（Template）语法","slug":"Django自定义模板","date":"2024-03-01T04:00:00.000Z","updated":"2024-03-08T04:00:00.000Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/Django自定义模板.json","excerpt":null,"covers":null,"content":"<h1 id=\"Django模板（Template）指南\"><a href=\"#Django模板（Template）指南\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Django模板（Template）指南\"></a>Django模板（Template）指南</h1><p>在Django中，模板（Template）是用来生成用户界面的重要组成部分。模板语法简洁而强大，能够帮助开发者将数据动态地呈现在网页上。以下是一份全面的Django模板指南，包括知识点、注意事项和示例。</p>\n<h2 id=\"模板（Template）基础知识\"><a href=\"#模板（Template）基础知识\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"模板（Template）基础知识\"></a>模板（Template）基础知识</h2><p>模板语法使用双花括号<code>&#123;&#123; &#125;&#125;</code>表示变量，使用<code>&#123;% %&#125;</code>表示模板标签。</p>\n<p>模板的文件后缀通常为<code>.html</code>，存放在<code>Django</code>项目中的<code>templates</code>目录下。</p>\n<h2 id=\"模板（Template）变量\"><a href=\"#模板（Template）变量\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"模板（Template）变量\"></a>模板（Template）变量</h2><p>在模板中通过变量展示动态数据：<br><figure class=\"highlight html\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta\">&lt;!DOCTYPE <span class=\"keyword\">html</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tag\">&lt;<span class=\"name\">html</span> <span class=\"attr\">lang</span>=<span class=\"string\">&quot;en&quot;</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tag\">&lt;<span class=\"name\">head</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"tag\">&lt;<span class=\"name\">title</span>&gt;</span>&#123;&#123; title &#125;&#125;<span class=\"tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"name\">title</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"name\">head</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tag\">&lt;<span class=\"name\">body</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"tag\">&lt;<span class=\"name\">h1</span>&gt;</span>你好, &#123;&#123; user.username &#125;&#125;<span class=\"tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"name\">h1</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"name\">body</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"name\">html</span>&gt;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></p>\n<h1 id=\"模板（Template）标签和过滤器\"><a href=\"#模板（Template）标签和过滤器\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"模板（Template）标签和过滤器\"></a>模板（Template）标签和过滤器</h1><p>使用模板标签实现逻辑控制、条件判断和循环：<br><figure class=\"highlight html\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta\">&lt;!DOCTYPE <span class=\"keyword\">html</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tag\">&lt;<span class=\"name\">html</span> <span class=\"attr\">lang</span>=<span class=\"string\">&quot;en&quot;</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tag\">&lt;<span class=\"name\">head</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"tag\">&lt;<span class=\"name\">title</span>&gt;</span>演示<span class=\"tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"name\">title</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"name\">head</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tag\">&lt;<span class=\"name\">body</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"tag\">&lt;<span class=\"name\">ul</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#123;% for product in products %&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"tag\">&lt;<span class=\"name\">li</span>&gt;</span>&#123;&#123; product.name &#125;&#125; - $&#123;&#123; product.price &#125;&#125;<span class=\"tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"name\">li</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#123;% empty %&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"tag\">&lt;<span class=\"name\">li</span>&gt;</span>No products available<span class=\"tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"name\">li</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#123;% endfor %&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"name\">ul</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"name\">body</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"name\">html</span>&gt;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></p>\n<h1 id=\"模板（Template）继承\"><a href=\"#模板（Template）继承\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"模板（Template）继承\"></a>模板（Template）继承</h1><p>通过继承减少代码重复，扩展基础模板：</p>\n<p><code>base.html</code><br><figure class=\"highlight html\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta\">&lt;!DOCTYPE <span class=\"keyword\">html</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tag\">&lt;<span class=\"name\">html</span> <span class=\"attr\">lang</span>=<span class=\"string\">&quot;en&quot;</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tag\">&lt;<span class=\"name\">head</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"tag\">&lt;<span class=\"name\">title</span>&gt;</span>&#123;% block title %&#125;我的网站&#123;% endblock %&#125;<span class=\"tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"name\">title</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"name\">head</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tag\">&lt;<span class=\"name\">body</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"tag\">&lt;<span class=\"name\">div</span> <span class=\"attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"string\">&quot;content&quot;</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        &#123;% block content %&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">        &#123;% endblock %&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"name\">div</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"name\">body</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"name\">html</span>&gt;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></p>\n<p><code>child.html</code><br><figure class=\"highlight html\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">&#123;% extends &#x27;base.html&#x27; %&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">&#123;% block title %&#125;子页面&#123;% endblock %&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">&#123;% block content %&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"tag\">&lt;<span class=\"name\">h1</span>&gt;</span>这里是子页面<span class=\"tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"name\">h1</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">&#123;% endblock %&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></p>\n<h1 id=\"静态（static）文件引用\"><a href=\"#静态（static）文件引用\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"静态（static）文件引用\"></a>静态（static）文件引用</h1><p>使用 <code>&#123;% static %&#125;</code> 模板标签引用静态文件，如<code>CSS</code>、<code>JavaScript</code>等。</p>\n<h1 id=\"模板（Template）注释\"><a href=\"#模板（Template）注释\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"模板（Template）注释\"></a>模板（Template）注释</h1><p>使用 `` 添加注释，方便阐述模板结构和逻辑。</p>\n","more":"<h1 id=\"Django模板（Template）指南\"><a href=\"#Django模板（Template）指南\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Django模板（Template）指南\"></a>Django模板（Template）指南</h1><p>在Django中，模板（Template）是用来生成用户界面的重要组成部分。模板语法简洁而强大，能够帮助开发者将数据动态地呈现在网页上。以下是一份全面的Django模板指南，包括知识点、注意事项和示例。</p>\n<h2 id=\"模板（Template）基础知识\"><a href=\"#模板（Template）基础知识\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"模板（Template）基础知识\"></a>模板（Template）基础知识</h2><p>模板语法使用双花括号<code>&#123;&#123; &#125;&#125;</code>表示变量，使用<code>&#123;% %&#125;</code>表示模板标签。</p>\n<p>模板的文件后缀通常为<code>.html</code>，存放在<code>Django</code>项目中的<code>templates</code>目录下。</p>\n<h2 id=\"模板（Template）变量\"><a href=\"#模板（Template）变量\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"模板（Template）变量\"></a>模板（Template）变量</h2><p>在模板中通过变量展示动态数据：<br><figure class=\"highlight html\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta\">&lt;!DOCTYPE <span class=\"keyword\">html</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tag\">&lt;<span class=\"name\">html</span> <span class=\"attr\">lang</span>=<span class=\"string\">&quot;en&quot;</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tag\">&lt;<span class=\"name\">head</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"tag\">&lt;<span class=\"name\">title</span>&gt;</span>&#123;&#123; title &#125;&#125;<span class=\"tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"name\">title</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"name\">head</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tag\">&lt;<span class=\"name\">body</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"tag\">&lt;<span class=\"name\">h1</span>&gt;</span>你好, &#123;&#123; user.username &#125;&#125;<span class=\"tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"name\">h1</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"name\">body</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"name\">html</span>&gt;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></p>\n<h1 id=\"模板（Template）标签和过滤器\"><a href=\"#模板（Template）标签和过滤器\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"模板（Template）标签和过滤器\"></a>模板（Template）标签和过滤器</h1><p>使用模板标签实现逻辑控制、条件判断和循环：<br><figure class=\"highlight html\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta\">&lt;!DOCTYPE <span class=\"keyword\">html</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tag\">&lt;<span class=\"name\">html</span> <span class=\"attr\">lang</span>=<span class=\"string\">&quot;en&quot;</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tag\">&lt;<span class=\"name\">head</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"tag\">&lt;<span class=\"name\">title</span>&gt;</span>演示<span class=\"tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"name\">title</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"name\">head</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tag\">&lt;<span class=\"name\">body</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"tag\">&lt;<span class=\"name\">ul</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#123;% for product in products %&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"tag\">&lt;<span class=\"name\">li</span>&gt;</span>&#123;&#123; product.name &#125;&#125; - $&#123;&#123; product.price &#125;&#125;<span class=\"tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"name\">li</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#123;% empty %&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"tag\">&lt;<span class=\"name\">li</span>&gt;</span>No products available<span class=\"tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"name\">li</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#123;% endfor %&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"name\">ul</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"name\">body</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"name\">html</span>&gt;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></p>\n<h1 id=\"模板（Template）继承\"><a href=\"#模板（Template）继承\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"模板（Template）继承\"></a>模板（Template）继承</h1><p>通过继承减少代码重复，扩展基础模板：</p>\n<p><code>base.html</code><br><figure class=\"highlight html\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta\">&lt;!DOCTYPE <span class=\"keyword\">html</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tag\">&lt;<span class=\"name\">html</span> <span class=\"attr\">lang</span>=<span class=\"string\">&quot;en&quot;</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tag\">&lt;<span class=\"name\">head</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"tag\">&lt;<span class=\"name\">title</span>&gt;</span>&#123;% block title %&#125;我的网站&#123;% endblock %&#125;<span class=\"tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"name\">title</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"name\">head</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tag\">&lt;<span class=\"name\">body</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"tag\">&lt;<span class=\"name\">div</span> <span class=\"attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"string\">&quot;content&quot;</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        &#123;% block content %&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">        &#123;% endblock %&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"name\">div</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"name\">body</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"name\">html</span>&gt;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></p>\n<p><code>child.html</code><br><figure class=\"highlight html\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">&#123;% extends &#x27;base.html&#x27; %&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">&#123;% block title %&#125;子页面&#123;% endblock %&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">&#123;% block content %&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"tag\">&lt;<span class=\"name\">h1</span>&gt;</span>这里是子页面<span class=\"tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"name\">h1</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">&#123;% endblock %&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></p>\n<h1 id=\"静态（static）文件引用\"><a href=\"#静态（static）文件引用\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"静态（static）文件引用\"></a>静态（static）文件引用</h1><p>使用 <code>&#123;% static %&#125;</code> 模板标签引用静态文件，如<code>CSS</code>、<code>JavaScript</code>等。</p>\n<h1 id=\"模板（Template）注释\"><a href=\"#模板（Template）注释\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"模板（Template）注释\"></a>模板（Template）注释</h1><p>使用 `` 添加注释，方便阐述模板结构和逻辑。</p>\n","categories":[{"name":"Python","path":"api/categories/Python.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"Python","path":"api/tags/Python.json"},{"name":"Django","path":"api/tags/Django.json"},{"name":"template","path":"api/tags/template.json"}]}